%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%Title: paper-store one-page resolution probe
%%Pages: 1
%%EndComments
% ONE page. Requests a 1200-dot grid but GUARDS it: if the interpreter can't do
% 1200 it silently keeps its own grid instead of aborting the job.
%
% Patterns are painted from a 1200-ppi *source* image (imagemask, dot-exact,
% immune to fill-adjust). Whatever grid the engine truly marks at samples that
% source:
%   * 600-native engine  -> "600" blocks stay crisp 1-on/1-off; "1200" blocks
%                           average to flat grey.
%   * 1200-capable axis  -> "1200" blocks also resolve (watch for the fast-scan
%                           vs process-direction asymmetry: one axis may win).
% period 4 src-px = 1-on/1-off at 600 dpi;  period 2 src-px = 1-on/1-off at 1200.

<< /PageSize [595 842] >> setpagedevice
{ << /HWResolution [1200 1200] >> setpagedevice } stopped pop   % try 1200, never abort

/mk150 { /b exch def /s 150 string def 0 1 149 { s exch b put } for s } def
/vP4 16#CC mk150 def                     % 11001100 -> vertical, 600 test
/vP2 16#AA mk150 def                     % 10101010 -> vertical, 1200 test
/hP4 1200 string def 0 1 1199 { /i exch def hP4 i i 4 mod 2 lt {16#80}{0} ifelse put } for
/hP2 1200 string def 0 1 1199 { /i exch def hP2 i i 2 mod 0 eq {16#80}{0} ifelse put } for

/VB { /s exch def /y exch def /x exch def       % ( x y str VB ) vertical stripes
  gsave x y translate 72 72 scale 0 setgray
  1200 1 true [1200 0 0 -1 0 1] { s } imagemask grestore } def
/HB { /s exch def /y exch def /x exch def
  gsave x y translate 72 72 scale 0 setgray
  1 1200 true [1 0 0 -1200 0 1200] { s } imagemask grestore } def

0 setgray
0.06 setlinewidth                        % ~1 dot at 1200; corner-to-corner X
0 0 moveto 595 842 lineto stroke  0 842 moveto 595 0 lineto stroke

/Helvetica-Bold findfont 13 scalefont setfont
60 780 moveto (paper-store one-page resolution probe  [requested HWResolution 1200, guarded]) show
/Helvetica findfont 9 scalefont setfont
60 766 moveto (Crisp 1-on/1-off = engine addresses that pitch. Flat grey = beyond its grid.) show
60 755 moveto (PPD advertises 600 only, so expect the 600 blocks crisp and the 1200 blocks grey.) show

72  520 vP4 VB   300 520 vP2 VB          % vertical-stripe blocks (probe H addressability)
72  300 hP4 HB   300 300 hP2 HB          % horizontal-stripe blocks (probe V addressability)

/Helvetica findfont 10 scalefont setfont
72  505 moveto (600 dpi  vertical stripes) show
300 505 moveto (1200 dpi  vertical stripes) show
72  285 moveto (600 dpi  horizontal stripes) show
300 285 moveto (1200 dpi  horizontal stripes) show

showpage
%%EOF
